<title>KB4961: Vulnerabilities Resolved in Veeam Management Pack for Microsoft System Center 13.1</title>
<meta name="Description" content="Veeam Management Pack for Microsoft System Center 13.1 resolves three vulnerabilities: CVE-2026-107239, CVE-2026-107238, and CVE-2023-22793. This article lists the severity, CVSS score, affected builds, and fixed build for each vulnerability."/>
